CREATE TRIGGER JurnalTransDelete  ON JurnalTrans FOR DELETE AS DECLARE @MID      INT DECLARE @VSLastId INT SELECT  @MID=TransID from Deleted SELECT @VSLastId=LastID from TablesID WHERE TablesID.TableName='JurnalTrans' IF @MID > @VSLastId BEGIN  RETURN END  Insert Operations (OperationID, OperationType, OperationTable)  SELECT Deleted.TransID, 'Delete' AS OperationType ,'JurnalTrans' AS OperationTable From Deleted 